 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_0d03d16b9b4334578527",
   "sourceHash": "0d03d16b9b43345785273516ac5c70c21c4e231da1f4a8c1466bdba066aa1cb2",
   "text": "个性化膳食计划：疗愈村的膳食会根据每位来访者独特的健康需求和体质能量（dosha）精心制备。这种个性化方式让每一餐都有助于促进身体的自然疗愈与更新过程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0dc9c7129a13d265b6c3",
   "sourceHash": "0dc9c7129a13d265b6c3c9f50cc9f68c383ee938bd1544294dd187375331d015",
   "text": "应季有机食材",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfd68ebef0187c71782a",
   "sourceHash": "bfd68ebef0187c71782af03c8a31a1bd26e8646c492975cdaa09ad56355c28e7",
   "text": "：为保留食物的营养完整性，我们选用本地出产的新鲜有机农产品和食材。凭借从农场到餐桌的方式，我们确保每一餐都健康、可持续，并与自然环境和谐共存。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source says 'guaranteed'; rendered as 确保 (ensure) without adding stronger claims. Owner may wish to soften the guarantee in EN too."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0fbe5278ec730cb80fb0",
   "sourceHash": "0fbe5278ec730cb80fb078089f793e0cd0e565550f4d969702cbaea59702e5bd",
   "text": "应季有机食材：为保留食物的营养完整性，我们选用本地出产的新鲜有机农产品和食材。凭借从农场到餐桌的方式，我们确保每一餐都健康、可持续，并与自然环境和谐共存。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source says 'guaranteed'; rendered as 确保 (ensure) without adding stronger claims. Owner may wish to soften the guarantee in EN too."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_02ea81ef6ce82af70b1e",
   "sourceHash": "02ea81ef6ce82af70b1ec732e13cdf57a7e8c7169b18fbad59581e19ee9013ef",
   "text": "消化健康",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_894495c17f1b12b40ee1",
   "sourceHash": "894495c17f1b12b40ee1b3166b51b079f7e375518a612437d562d6a9e07c7d81",
   "text": "：阿育吠陀烹饪使用姜、茴香、姜黄、孜然等香料来帮助改善消化。这些香料不仅增添风味，还可通过激发阿耆尼（Agni，即消化之火）来促进营养吸收、提升整体活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9f59b81b81f25016f9bc",
   "sourceHash": "9f59b81b81f25016f9bc1713516be3cb9894566cbc7cb0258be6230bfe145bda",
   "text": "消化健康：阿育吠陀烹饪使用姜、茴香、姜黄、孜然等香料来帮助改善消化。这些香料不仅增添风味，还可通过激发阿耆尼（Agni，即消化之火）来促进营养吸收、提升整体活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70d206a3756ed5ad2e5d",
   "sourceHash": "70d206a3756ed5ad2e5d7b1d1f86cd3431c721aa02055df8c079475ad24b9852",
   "text": "排毒与疗愈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5f2f7d6eef9f725b5d1f",
   "sourceHash": "5f2f7d6eef9f725b5d1f9b8b5c9f26a289b9113291fbfa138eeb3c672ec71220",
   "text": "：阿育吠陀疗愈村提供多种食物，旨在温和排毒，促进身体的自然净化过程。从草本茶到清淡汤品，每一餐都有助于整体疗愈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9890a3cf3907a4fb6394",
   "sourceHash": "9890a3cf3907a4fb6394565af230b8fed803849ea69a97a9ac39d5c395b2f2a4",
   "text": "排毒与疗愈：阿育吠陀疗愈村提供多种食物，旨在温和排毒，促进身体的自然净化过程。从草本茶到清淡汤品，每一餐都有助于整体疗愈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c840280128f910f6b829",
   "sourceHash": "c840280128f910f6b829f67df37a99dedab3e43c3d030e2c01754cecf8107ff3",
   "text": "烹饪简约，风味丰富",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f8c65c2cf4623cef71df",
   "sourceHash": "f8c65c2cf4623cef71df0afba8d62ad685244cde18558989a111ea7b30ed24f8",
   "text": "：阿育吠陀膳食体现了简约之美，以清爽、朴素的烹制方式凸显每种食材的天然风味与特性，使膳食既富有营养又易于消化。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_872acbc97a7421504f4e",
   "sourceHash": "872acbc97a7421504f4e4a08538d19f3c7399c3e9d4a495147b1879bb234820a",
   "text": "烹饪简约，风味丰富：阿育吠陀膳食体现了简约之美，以清爽、朴素的烹制方式凸显每种食材的天然风味与特性，使膳食既富有营养又易于消化。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b838f732ba1676044d5",
   "sourceHash": "4b838f732ba1676044d5a25dadba709c7ab54c13f1cbeb974420b6bc9676e117",
   "text": "与众不同的用餐体验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a9b167bd6614acf2727",
   "sourceHash": "8a9b167bd6614acf2727200fd5ffb538eac437b318ac0578834becc77a6f1d35",
   "text": "在阿育吠陀疗愈村用餐是一种超越味觉的沉浸式体验。宁静的氛围与精心制备的膳食相结合，有助于培养正念，并对所获得的滋养心怀感恩。我们鼓励来访者从容、专注地进食，充分感受食物的质地、风味与香气。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 来访者 (visitors) per clinical language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b862183c564693ba426",
   "sourceHash": "6b862183c564693ba4265241a43f00281fcfddbad277d5fd748c11ec8d4734ab",
   "text": "将阿育吠陀膳食融入日常生活",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03e2052d941c61a5c6c6",
   "sourceHash": "03e2052d941c61a5c6c66dbd1fd5b23b18e7186bdf9176d377215de01c827605",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村还鼓励来访者在家中实践阿育吠陀烹饪。工作坊和现场演示将向来访者介绍基于体质能量（dosha）的菜肴、正念饮食的价值，以及各种草药和香料的健康益处。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 来访者 (visitors) per clinical language lock."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
